// 异常页外层：让 Result 水平 + 垂直居中。
// 原写法把 .result 绝对定位且没给 left/right，宽度会退化成内容宽度、位置停在静态左侧，整页因此左偏。
// / Exception wrapper: center the Result on both axes.
// The old .result was absolutely positioned without left/right, so its width shrank to its content
// size and kept its static left position, which pushed the whole page off-center.
.wrapper
  display flex
  align-items center
  justify-content center
  background-color var(--td-bg-color-container)
  height calc(100vh - 168px)
